    "source": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Vita3K/Vita3K/master/vita3k/config/include/config/config.h",
    "notes": "Reference only: Vita3K keeps config.yml (and per-app custom configs) in its app-specific storage. Keys are the YAML names from config.h."
